{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wjy9sry9","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":55,"top":407,"width":520,"height":150},"name":"cvdetail","text":"CV Tools 输出圆、线段和标签候选。\nSupervisor 对照原图：主圆有完整笔画，\n保留为完整圆；另一候选只贴合局部片段，\n原图无对应圆弧，因此不绘制。\n标签有遗漏时，再结合原图补核。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xk7qlczu","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":55,"top":590,"width":520,"height":125},"name":"gesdetail","text":"Geometry 子 Agent 将确认的图元整理为\n几何骨架：哪些点相连、在哪里相交，\n以及圆心、半径、标签与点的对应关系。\n把骨架和未决冲突写入 GES，供生成使用。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ahwrqhgj","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":590,"top":557.6,"width":480,"height":125},"name":"v1detail","text":"TikZ 子 Agent 根据 GES 生成图形代码。\n程序完成后修复、编译和渲染，\n再交给 Critic 子 Agent 对照原图检查。\n本例后修复未改坐标，主体已画对。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bip8jmho","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":1100,"top":557.6,"width":465,"height":135},"name":"v2detail","text":"Critic 子 Agent 发现端点伸出了圆周。\nSupervisor 将意见交给 TikZ 子 Agent。\n按圆心、半径及选定方向重设端点，\n让线段收在圆周上；重新编译后，\n再由 Critic 检查，确认问题已解决。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
